{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15171","headline":"送襄阳李尚书 · 李益","name":"送襄阳李尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天寒发梅柳，忆昔到襄州。\n树暖然红烛，江清展碧油。\n风烟临岘首，云水接昭丘。\n俗尚春秋学，词称文选楼。\n都门送旌节，符竹领诸侯。\n汉沔分戎寄，黎元减圣忧。\n时追山简兴，本自习家流。\n莫废思康乐，诗情满沃洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}